# Srtforge environment variable example.
#
# Copy this to `.env` and fill in only what you need. Real values must
# never be committed. The default test/CI path requires NONE of these.
#
# See `docs/architecture/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `srtforge/settings.py` for
# how each variable is resolved.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hugging Face — required only for private model downloads (e.g. some
# Parakeet variants). Public models work without this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HF_TOKEN=hf_xxx_replace_me

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gemini — only used when ``gemini.enabled`` is true in the YAML config.
# Off by default. Stays local without this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GEMINI_API_KEY=replace_me

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Persistent config path override. The default is resolved per
# `srtforge.settings.get_persistent_config_path` (next to the frozen exe,
# then PROJECT_ROOT/srtforge.config, then the OS user config dir).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SRTFORGE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=C:\path\to\srtforge.config

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pin the project root used by `srtforge.config.PROJECT_ROOT`. Useful when
# running a frozen exe from a different working directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SRTFORGE_PROJECT_ROOT=C:\path\to\Srtforge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: alternative bundled config YAML.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SRTFORGE_CONFIG=C:\path\to\config.yaml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: where the PyInstaller specs should pick up ffmpeg/ffprobe.
# The installers set this for you; no need to set it manually for normal use.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SRTFORGE_FFMPEG_DIR=C:\path\to\ffmpeg\bin
